      "content": "That's a good start, very clear. But to be honest, the length score for this draft is looking pretty low. It's a bit too brief for the \"comprehensive\" requirement of the library, even if the content is good. Could you expand on this significantly? \n\nTry to go much deeper into the mathematical derivation of the inequality itself and the specific experimental setups (like the Aspect experiment) to really drive the length up. Again, please just make sure it stays meaningful—don't just repeat yourself—but I really need much more volume here to pass the system's threshold.",
